WEBVTT

00:03:56.803 --> 00:04:00.901
And then I remember
looking at a picture of him,

00:04:00.925 --> 00:04:04.225
realizing for the first time

00:04:04.249 --> 00:04:07.897
that he is the largest guy in the picture.

00:04:07.921 --> 00:04:09.663
(Laughter)

00:04:10.334 --> 00:04:11.879
And it hit me.

00:04:11.903 --> 00:04:16.612
Finally, I realized he wasn't starving.

00:04:17.632 --> 00:04:20.800
But I was never able to see that before,

00:04:20.824 --> 00:04:24.539
until someone told me that he was fat.

00:04:24.563 --> 00:04:25.684
(Laughter)

00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:29.426
Really, someone had to teach me
that he was fat.